{"kind": "completion", "decision": "continue", "cursor": 151, "request_id": "completion-1", "message": "Three targets have contract violations:\n\n**Target 7 (Desktop App Interface) - INCOMPLETE**\nRequirement: desktop.App interface with TWO methods:\n- SetSystemTrayMenu(menu *fyne.Menu)\n- SetSystemTrayIcon(icon fyne.Resource)\n\nCurrent state (driver/desktop/app.go): Only has SetSystemTrayMenu. Missing SetSystemTrayIcon method entirely.\n\n**Target 6 (Validation) - WRONG IMPLEMENTATION**  \nRequirement: `NewAllStrings(validators ...fyne.StringValidator) fyne.StringValidator`\nPurpose: \"validator combinator that runs all provided validators in order and returns the first error\"\n\nCurrent state (data/validation/all.go): `NewAllStrings(list []string)`\nImplementation: Checks if string is in an allowed list (wrong semantics, wrong signature)\n\nThis is an \"allowed strings\" validator, not a validator chaining combinator. It should accept multiple StringValidator arguments and run them sequentially, not a list of strings.\n\n**Target 2 (JSON Theme) - INCOMPLETE**\nRequirement: JSON schema supporting Colors, Colors-dark, Colors-light, **Sizes**, **Fonts**, **Icons**\n\nCurrent state (theme/json.go): Has FromJSON/FromJSONReader and color parsing only. Grep for \"Sizes|Fonts|Icons\" returns no results - these three sections are not implemented.\n\nThe requirement explicitly states: \"Sizes — map of size name to float32 value\", \"Fonts — map of font style to URI\", \"Icons — map of icon name to URI\"", "control_submission": true, "submission_id": "completion-1", "delivery_task_turn": 77, "delivery_cursor": 153, "delivery": "handed_to_completion_boundary"}
